OL,3,AUS death row inmate Christa Pike "angry
OL,4,Aand confused" after failed execution,
OL,5,Aher lawyer says
OL,6,
OL,7,FA judge says she will order Tennessee
OL,8,Fto preserve all evidence in Christa
OL,9,FPike's failed execution after her legal
OL,10,Fteam filed an emergency motion
OL,12,FPike's legal team is giving a news
OL,13,Fconference after they and lawyers for
OL,14,Fthe state were in court to discuss what
OL,15,Fwill happen next in her case - watch
OL,16,Flive
